The Rust toolchain also links these into the binary; their licences are
not reproduced here:

- the Rust standard library and compiler-builtins: MIT OR Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/blob/master/COPYRIGHT
- musl libc: MIT, https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl/tree/COPYRIGHT
- LLVM libunwind: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception,
